{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act18d3_level_act18d3_06_end",
  "groupId": "act18d3",
  "stageId": "act18d3_06",
  "title": "厌食",
  "storyCode": "SV-6",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act18d3/level_act18d3_06_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "3ef6565f5aeef84d1de2864984221939a77f4edf51f3db83a4d1b5f875e59339",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "咳咳咳......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "......对象是人的话，力道和角度很难控制。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "没、没事......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "（嗅了嗅自己）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "是不流血了啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "它们为什么还这么兴奋？这里的恐鱼本来就这么多吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "是昨天那种怪物吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "差不多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "我以前没见过哩。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "这几天你们不要到这里来了。快回去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "歌手。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "......不要拽我的裙子。你不是那么小的小孩子了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "我是想说......我想好我要什么了。我想听你唱歌。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "哦......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "因为......我不知道什么是歌。我听到你在梦里哼了。但我听不懂。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "歌手，你答应了？这是不是就是约定？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "算是吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "（皱眉）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "我的琴。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "咦？是啊，歌手，你的琴去哪里了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "......我回去找。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "好，我帮你一起找。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "这是不是说，你愿意跟我一起回去啦？太、太好了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "真的......值得这么高兴？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "嗨，墙灰，早上好呀！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "text": "铁皮......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "对啊，铁皮去哪里了？你们之前一直形影不离啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "text": "铁皮。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "你盯着的方向......是海......吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "难道说，昨天抽到红色贝壳的人，是铁皮？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "唉......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "text": "木框，我的病好像更严重了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "text": "我的胸口很涨，像是要爆开一样。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "text": "我连东西都不想吃。你不要和我说话了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "......唉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "歌手，欢迎再次来到我们家！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老年居民",
      "text": "呃......啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "你奶奶......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "佩特拉奶奶还在休息呢。昨天我们一起回到这里，她就一直躺着。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "我想，她也消耗了很大体力，肯定很累了。我没想到她会冲出来，对审判官那样说话。她变得和平时都不一样。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "你说的对。她很......厉害。她打退了审判官。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老年居民",
      "text": "呵......哈......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "打退了......审判官？！歌手，你这么说，要是让审判官听见，她一定又要生气了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "随便她。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "要是她想再动手......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "她不会再来找你麻烦了吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "......找谁的麻烦都一样。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "（摸箱子）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "对了，我们出去找琴吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "等一下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "哎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "你头上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "哇！好多绿色的黏黏的东西......这、这是什么东西呀？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "是海藻。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "是刚才摔跤时候蹭到的吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "大概。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "这些......有用吗？看起来和海草长得差不多。能不能等风吹干了拿来铺床？佩特拉奶奶腰不舒服，正好用得上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "......给我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "你用贝壳将这些海藻磨碎。不要洗掉这些粘液。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "加上一点海水，记得没过海藻。装进这个小罐子里，封好口。放半年。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "等罐子里的液体的绿色淡了，说明发酵好了，就可以喝啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "......歌手。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "怎么了？是不是没听明白？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "你......你好像从来没一口气对我说过这么多话！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "贝壳也不用扔，洗净晒干，当喝酒的容器用。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "酒？那是什么东西？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "那里写着。这里原先是所酒吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "原来这个字是酒的意思！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "他们说喝酒能带来快乐，忘记烦恼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "真的吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "......没用。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "不过，味道还不错。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "你以前经常喝这个吗？在你的家乡......阿戈尔？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "不大一样。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "......有时候会一起喝类似的，在跳舞之前。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "你们那时候一定很快乐。噢，我明白啦！不是酒能带来快乐，是快乐的时候，我们喝酒。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "生活在外面的人，呃，是不是都会喝酒？大家是不是都很快乐？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "未必。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "我懂了。那他们一定没有我现在这么快乐。歌手，谢谢你教我做这个酒。我真想马上就和你一起喝。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "你的手势错了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "这么碾的话，很难碾碎。你可以换个角度，用最尖的部分对准海藻的纹理。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "掌握韵律，调整呼吸......令你的手，你的身体，与触到你肌肤的海风融为一体。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "像这样——一击，即碎。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "你盯着我，是还想动手吗？只有你一个人的话，结束得很快。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "text": "不......没有。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "text": "这个，还给你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "这是我的琴。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "text": "是铁皮捡到的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "text": "他昨天夜里看到你把这东西掉在了外面。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "哎呀，太好了！歌手，我们不用去找琴了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "text": "铁皮他，他把这东西偷偷拿回了我们住的房子，让我......让我把它给你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "text": "说完这个他就走了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "谢谢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "text": "啊？啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "（拨琴）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "这个调子......咦，是你晚上睡着时候哼着的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "它经常在我脑子里。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "这是你和你的同伴，你们以前会唱的歌吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "在家的时候，这样的歌还有很多。我们用歌声......对彼此说话。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "离开以后，其他歌声都消失了。我一个人，只剩下这个。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "难怪，这首歌听起来很让人难过。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "（拨琴）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "歌手，我们的约定！你拿回了琴，是不是可以为我们唱歌了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "我们可都等着哩，是吧，佩特拉奶奶？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老年居民",
      "text": "唔......呃啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "奶奶今天说不出话了。不然她一定也想跟着唱哩。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老年居民",
      "text": "啊......啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "歌手，佩特拉奶奶想听呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一个猎人他走上海岸♪\n他的家乡在后，他的路在身前♪\n父母与儿女都与他失散♪\n他的恋人已经葬身大海♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "text": "你的表情有一丝变化。你是否感受到了什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "text": "没什么。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "text": "并不意外，你的神经依旧迟钝。看看你面前的这些水。水位的起伏，波纹的频率，光泽的跃动。这些都是讯息。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "text": "快要涨潮了。我们该上去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一个猎人他走上海岸♪\n他的家乡在后，徒余哀叹♪\n他的路没有尽头♪\n他的路浓雾弥漫♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官",
      "text": "她在唱歌。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官",
      "text": "她竟然，在这个破房子里，在这些人面前唱歌。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官",
      "text": "这些人......他们也竟然在听。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官",
      "text": "低着头的人依然低着头。不会说话的人依然冻着舌头。歌声明明没法进到他们僵硬的躯壳里。可他们的眼睛......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官",
      "text": "他们，听懂了吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "居民",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "佩特拉奶奶？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "她怎么了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "她......睡着了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "我很少见她睡得这么安稳。以前她一闭眼就会大叫，在空气里乱抓。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "我还以为听见你唱歌，她会想要跳舞。她总是嚷嚷着想跳舞哩。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "墙灰？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "text": "我要死了。我的眼睛......进了海水。好咸，一点都不好喝。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "哇，你这是......你是不是哭了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "text": "哭？什么是哭？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "......是从你身体深处流淌出来的情绪。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "text": "这样......吗？我还是不大明白。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "歌手，我喜欢你的歌。你不爱说话，可是你的歌里有许多话。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "你愿意再唱一遍吗？我想听你说更多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "（拨琴）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民C",
      "text": "吃的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民D",
      "text": "有吃的到了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民C",
      "text": "去海滩上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民D",
      "text": "教士！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
